{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>... I don\u2019t know how I ended up here \u2013 maybe I just walked through the wrong door. But one thing I know for sure: this place shouldn\u2019t exist. This is the Unplace.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>At first it seems empty: I walk through room after room, and nothing happens. And then - as if the system switches on. I tried to run, but it became clear every time: I won\u2019t be let go that easily. <strong>This place has one rule: face the trials.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726670/extras/dc904a64fbda37219d280d5b87607c6b.poster.avif?t=1763027910\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726670/extras/dc904a64fbda37219d280d5b87607c6b.webm?t=1763027910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726670/extras/dc904a64fbda37219d280d5b87607c6b.mp4?t=1763027910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in an otherworldly place - the Unplace.<br>It wants to play with you in many different ways, even if the price of the game is your life.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay sharp</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the nature of each trial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some challenges test your reflexes, others your focus, and others still your dexterity and nerves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake costs you the entire path</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creeping, ever-building sense of tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of unique and demanding challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world that loops back on itself \u2013 unpredictable and constantly shifting</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3726670?t=1763027910","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3726670?t=1763027910","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726670/3d0ac57e7ef22adf5c05bf31ceb52fb33aa7add7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763027910","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726670/3d0ac57e7ef22adf5c05bf31ceb52fb33aa7add7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763027910","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4063040,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>... I don\u2019t know how I ended up here \u2013 maybe I just walked through the wrong door. But one thing I know for sure: this place shouldn\u2019t exist. This is the Unplace.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>At first it seems empty: I walk through room after room, and nothing happens. And then - as if the system switches on. I tried to run, but it became clear every time: I won\u2019t be let go that easily. <strong>This place has one rule: face the trials.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726670/extras/dc904a64fbda37219d280d5b87607c6b.poster.avif?t=1763027910\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726670/extras/dc904a64fbda37219d280d5b87607c6b.webm?t=1763027910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726670/extras/dc904a64fbda37219d280d5b87607c6b.mp4?t=1763027910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in an otherworldly place - the Unplace.<br>It wants to play with you in many different ways, even if the price of the game is your life.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay sharp</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the nature of each trial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some challenges test your reflexes, others your focus, and others still your dexterity and nerves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake costs you the entire path</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creeping, ever-building sense of tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of unique and demanding challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world that loops back on itself \u2013 unpredictable and constantly shifting</p></li></ul>","developers":["Right Hand Lab"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726670/9df9ffc6f01435d5ec99dfdd5eb19c5bd0bc3d2d/header.jpg?t=1763027910","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3726670/1030937704/e5af8bcfb3730f513080bbae71d5e3d62df4491e/1759361328/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759366685","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3726670/1030937704/e5af8bcfb3730f513080bbae71d5e3d62df4491e/1759361328/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759366685","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3726670/1030937704/e5af8bcfb3730f513080bbae71d5e3d62df4491e/1759361328/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759366685","id":257210410,"name":"trailer_gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257210410/652ea72042a9899837913dc1c8395194d7a08c16/m